### ===================================================================
### BankSphere REST API Test File (for VS Code 'REST Client' extension)
### Install "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) in VS Code to click "Send Request"
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Actuator Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Swagger OpenAPI Specification
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. User Login
# @name loginRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### Store token from response (automatic with REST Client)
@authToken = {{loginRequest.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Create New Account (requires Bearer token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "customerId": "d3b07384-d113-467f-a63e-f823297a7e8e",
  "accountType": "SAVINGS",
  "currency": "INR",
  "branchCode": "001",
  "initialDeposit": 5000.00
}

### 5. Get Account Balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/BSP2026000000001/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Initiate Internal Transfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/transfer/internal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "sourceAccountNumber": "BSP2026000000001",
  "destinationAccountNumber": "BSP2026000000002",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "description": "Payment for services",
  "narration": "Monthly settlement"
}

### 7. Calculate Loan EMI
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/calculate-emi?principal=100000&rate=12&months=12
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
